sequenceDiagram
    actor Buyer
    participant Browser
    participant AuthFilter
    participant CheckoutServlet
    participant OrderService
    participant CartDao
    participant ProductDao
    participant OrderDao
    participant Database as H2 Database

    Buyer->>Browser: Click "Confirm and place order"
    Browser->>AuthFilter: POST /checkout
    AuthFilter->>AuthFilter: Verify session
    AuthFilter->>CheckoutServlet: Forward request
    CheckoutServlet->>OrderService: checkout(buyerId)

    OrderService->>CartDao: findByUserId(buyerId)
    CartDao->>Database: SELECT cart_items
    Database-->>CartDao: cart rows
    CartDao-->>OrderService: List<CartItem>

    loop for each cart item
        OrderService->>ProductDao: findByIdForUpdate(productId)
        ProductDao->>Database: SELECT product FOR UPDATE
        Database-->>ProductDao: product row
        ProductDao-->>OrderService: Product
        OrderService->>OrderService: Check stock, add to running total
    end

    OrderService->>OrderDao: create(order)
    OrderDao->>Database: INSERT INTO orders
    Database-->>OrderDao: generated order id
    OrderDao-->>OrderService: orderId

    loop for each cart item
        OrderService->>ProductDao: decrementStock(productId, qty)
        ProductDao->>Database: UPDATE products SET stock_qty
        OrderService->>OrderDao: addItem(orderId, productId, qty, price)
        OrderDao->>Database: INSERT INTO order_items
    end

    OrderService->>CartDao: clear(buyerId)
    CartDao->>Database: DELETE FROM cart_items

    OrderService-->>CheckoutServlet: orderId
    CheckoutServlet-->>Browser: Redirect /orders?placed={orderId}
    Browser-->>Buyer: "Order #N confirmed. Thank you."